  "aborted_benchmark": {
    "path": "once-campfire-mojo/bench/results/2026-10-10-m4-byte-safety",
    "reason": "C returned one HTTP 503 while posting in round 2. Its request writer had a 1-second SQLite lock budget, versus Rust 5 seconds and Mojo 10. A controlled lock reproduced C 503. Opt-in Rust/C durable write connections now use the same 10 seconds as Mojo; the full nine-run experiment was restarted. Earlier samples are preserved separately, not mixed into this table."
  },
